The derived type paradigm sometimes requires changes to the API of encapsulated modules.
Doxygen and Graphviz can help to visualize the call tree so that the required alterations can
be made.

The easiest way to install Doxygen and Graphviz is via Conda/Mamba.

conda create --name=doxygen
conda activate doxygen
conda install conda-forge::doxygen
conda install anaconda::graphviz

You should then be able to run the following command to generate the Doxygen HTMLs:

doxygen doxygen.config

If run on and HPC system, it is recommended to tar and download the HTML folder to your local machine, as the many
small files are usually slow to load when opening the folder directly the HPC.

To view the results, open:

html/index.html
